    "detailed_description": "Set in a bizarre yet wonderful world, Liam_99 is a <strong>story-driven, adventure and exploration game.</strong> You\u2019ll play as - <i>and sometimes alongside</i> - <strong>Liam,</strong> a skeleton who lost every memories of his past life... <strong>but still knows he's the main character of a video game!</strong><br><br>Helping Liam remember who he was will require you to overcome <strong>four major adventures,</strong> each one very different from the others - <strong>in terms of environment and ambiance as well as gameplay-wise.</strong> Brace yourself for <strong>various challenges</strong> such as <strong>obstacle races</strong> or <strong>puzzles,</strong> exalted with a <strong>touch of 4th wall-breaking and absurd jokes!</strong><br><br>In addition to these four adventures, Liam_99 shall let you <strong>roam freely a world full of wonders and secrets.</strong> Discover <strong>famous works of art</strong> (anew), plunder <strong>treasure chests</strong> and collect <strong>strange keys,</strong> venture <strong>deep underground\u2026</strong> or have a moment to take in the view and appreciate Liam\u2019s jokes. <i>Whatever works best for you!</i><br><br><strong>Liam_99 aims to offer a refreshing, carefully designed experience.</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/686752c8d69370669a87a718e3d2c020.poster.avif?t=1682514735\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/686752c8d69370669a87a718e3d2c020.webm?t=1682514735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/686752c8d69370669a87a718e3d2c020.mp4?t=1682514735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The game shall be fully voice-acted in French, as well as in English - if the crowdfunding campaign is enough of a success.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/b6888974c3bbcd9ecd497c60972e1656.poster.avif?t=1682514735\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/b6888974c3bbcd9ecd497c60972e1656.webm?t=1682514735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/b6888974c3bbcd9ecd497c60972e1656.mp4?t=1682514735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Spoiler alert: Liam's past is hardly a bed of roses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/eb7755de1730b2b91bb1ce2bb4b8b13a.poster.avif?t=1682514735\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/eb7755de1730b2b91bb1ce2bb4b8b13a.webm?t=1682514735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/eb7755de1730b2b91bb1ce2bb4b8b13a.mp4?t=1682514735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The breaking of the 4th wall lies at the core of Liam_99's design and narration.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/dc7140bc729eda3fba9424cea150f856.poster.avif?t=1682514735\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/dc7140bc729eda3fba9424cea150f856.webm?t=1682514735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/dc7140bc729eda3fba9424cea150f856.mp4?t=1682514735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>If you think that Death is restful, you may change your mind after playing the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADDITIONAL FEATURES</h2><br><br>- An open afterworld to explore<br><br>- Many cutscenes to skip (please don't)<br><br>- A day/night cycle and weather system",
    "about_the_game": "Set in a bizarre yet wonderful world, Liam_99 is a <strong>story-driven, adventure and exploration game.</strong> You\u2019ll play as - <i>and sometimes alongside</i> - <strong>Liam,</strong> a skeleton who lost every memories of his past life... <strong>but still knows he's the main character of a video game!</strong><br><br>Helping Liam remember who he was will require you to overcome <strong>four major adventures,</strong> each one very different from the others - <strong>in terms of environment and ambiance as well as gameplay-wise.</strong> Brace yourself for <strong>various challenges</strong> such as <strong>obstacle races</strong> or <strong>puzzles,</strong> exalted with a <strong>touch of 4th wall-breaking and absurd jokes!</strong><br><br>In addition to these four adventures, Liam_99 shall let you <strong>roam freely a world full of wonders and secrets.</strong> Discover <strong>famous works of art</strong> (anew), plunder <strong>treasure chests</strong> and collect <strong>strange keys,</strong> venture <strong>deep underground\u2026</strong> or have a moment to take in the view and appreciate Liam\u2019s jokes. <i>Whatever works best for you!</i><br><br><strong>Liam_99 aims to offer a refreshing, carefully designed experience.</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/686752c8d69370669a87a718e3d2c020.poster.avif?t=1682514735\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/686752c8d69370669a87a718e3d2c020.webm?t=1682514735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/686752c8d69370669a87a718e3d2c020.mp4?t=1682514735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The game shall be fully voice-acted in French, as well as in English - if the crowdfunding campaign is enough of a success.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/b6888974c3bbcd9ecd497c60972e1656.poster.avif?t=1682514735\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/b6888974c3bbcd9ecd497c60972e1656.webm?t=1682514735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/b6888974c3bbcd9ecd497c60972e1656.mp4?t=1682514735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Spoiler alert: Liam's past is hardly a bed of roses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/eb7755de1730b2b91bb1ce2bb4b8b13a.poster.avif?t=1682514735\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/eb7755de1730b2b91bb1ce2bb4b8b13a.webm?t=1682514735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/eb7755de1730b2b91bb1ce2bb4b8b13a.mp4?t=1682514735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The breaking of the 4th wall lies at the core of Liam_99's design and narration.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/dc7140bc729eda3fba9424cea150f856.poster.avif?t=1682514735\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/dc7140bc729eda3fba9424cea150f856.webm?t=1682514735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288190/extras/dc7140bc729eda3fba9424cea150f856.mp4?t=1682514735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>If you think that Death is restful, you may change your mind after playing the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADDITIONAL FEATURES</h2><br><br>- An open afterworld to explore<br><br>- Many cutscenes to skip (please don't)<br><br>- A day/night cycle and weather system",
    "short_description": "Liam_99 tells the story of a little skeleton, amnesic but aware of being the central character in a video game, off on a journey of self-discovery through a vast afterworld. Embark with your favorite protagonist (soon enough) on a humorous yet poetic adventure!",
    "supported_languages": "English, French<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe best video game ever made!\u201d<br>11/10 \u2013 Liam T. Mars (main character of the game, in all objectivity)<br>",
